      "diff": "@@ -146,7 +146,9 @@ if(WIN32)\n \t# on Windows can be slow.\n \tset(HAVE_FCNTL_H TRUE)\n \tset(HAVE_FLOORL TRUE)\n-endif(WIN32)\n+elseif(APPLE)\n+    include(UseAppleSilicon)\n+endif()\n \n include(UseCustomIncludes)\n ADD_CUSTOM_CMAKE_INCLUDE()\n",
